{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r0","runHash":"f97e3b3f","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r0.eef9c44d.mp3","audioBytes":183648,"durationMs":61093,"runEndMs":27753,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7022,7022],[15379,7022],[21343,12986],[22043,12986],[26234,17177],[35551,17177],[35901,17187],[36601,17187],[40796,21382],[42296,27353],[42696,27753],[61093,27753]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6672,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Qwen 3.8 27B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":7022,"endMs":10106,"runMs":7022,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10456,"endMs":15029,"runMs":7022,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15379,"endMs":18902,"runMs":7022,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":22043,"endMs":25684,"runMs":12986,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 0 is on the wiki. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":26934,"endMs":30554,"runMs":17177,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 18 steps."},{"audioMs":30904,"endMs":32077,"runMs":17177,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":32427,"endMs":35551,"runMs":17177,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":36601,"endMs":40046,"runMs":17187,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":42696,"endMs":49172,"runMs":27753,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":49522,"endMs":56177,"runMs":27753,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":56527,"endMs":57560,"runMs":27753,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":57910,"endMs":58893,"runMs":27753,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":4}}
